# Product requirements documents — kept locally, not versioned
/KudiKit_PRD*.pdf
/Kudikit_Product Requirements Document*.pdf


# NOTE: ios/Flutter/{Debug,Release}.xcconfig and
# macos/Flutter/Flutter-{Debug,Release}.xcconfig are NOT local files — the Xcode
# projects reference them, so they must stay tracked (they were once ignored
# here, which left fresh clones unable to build iOS/macOS). Only the generated
# Generated.xcconfig / ephemeral/ next to them are ignored.

# Flutter DevTools & OpenCode
devtools_options.yaml
config.json


